and video input (video_url parts; MP4, WebM, MOV, MKV via PyAV). The image tower takes a request's images in groups of
16,384 patches, 96 MiB request bodies. The video code (vision/videos.py, the timestamped frame-group prompt, frame
encoding) is MiaAI-Lab's Flash Next v0.6.0 patch, ported unchanged to the qwen3_5 frontend.

